                "metadata": {
                    "category": "stories",
                    "author": "Marvel Press",
                    "description": "Get ready for web-slinging fun with Spidey, Ghost-Spider and Spin in this action-packed story collection! Join the team as they take on epic missions and save the day—one adventure at a time. Perfect for young superheroes, this thrilling collection is packed with excitement, friendship, and plenty of Spidey power!\n\nCollection includes six action-packed adventures:\n- Gob-Zilla\n- Lost And Found\n- Bootsie's Day Out\n- The Maltese Kitten\n- A Day With Black Panther\n- Follow That Sea Monster",
